    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63c6149a4879e7008cb24ce0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63c6149a4879e7008cb24ce0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Jan 2023 02:59:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：冰冰</span><span><span>@冰冰Yaho</span></span><span>&nbsp;、大翟@翟佳宁 、思宇@思宇呀啊 、流星雨</span></p><br><p><span>了解更多，或想看我们的线下脱口秀演出，微博/ 微信公众号：@仙人掌喜剧&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>联系我们，可以添加仙人掌小助手：xianrenzhangxiju0829</span></p><br><p><span>快过年了，又能吃到家乡味了，一种食物往往代表着一些回忆、一段经历。每座城市都有专属的美食风味，你的家乡都有哪些美食呢？生活这么多年，有没有让你不能理解的食物？南北方美食究竟有多少差异？本期节目，四位主播和大家聊聊一些美食和饮食差异~</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">0:02:10</a>&nbsp;杭州就是美食荒漠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">0:03:25</a>&nbsp;吃火锅自助要了40盘肉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">0:8:50</a>&nbsp;特地去青岛吃海鲜结果去错了季节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">0:13:10</a>&nbsp;东北菜绝了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">0:16:15</a>&nbsp;杭州特色美食：韩料</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">0:17:00</a> 吃到好吃的我会翩翩起舞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">0:27:10</a>&nbsp;湖南、川渝的辣都不值一提，江西的辣才是真的服辣！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2321">0:38:41</a>&nbsp;你对安徽料理的理解过于片面</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">0:43:40</a>&nbsp;河北人就爱碳水配碳水</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">0:56:00</a>&nbsp;特别的饮食习惯：蛋黄拌酱油，蘸饺子吃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3921">1:05:21</a>&nbsp;南果梨天下第一</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4260">1:11:00</a>&nbsp;为了吃你能排多久队？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4708">1:18:28</a>&nbsp;南北咸甜之争</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5080">1:24:40</a>&nbsp;为了另一半你会改变饮食习惯吗？</span></p>]]></description>
