  <item>
    <title>vol.17 只有我在大众点评和闲鱼，关注前任动态吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/638838a2dcb6444e6ab611a5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">638838a2dcb6444e6ab611a5</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Dec 2022 05:03:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：冰冰</span><span><span>@冰冰Yaho</span></span><span>&nbsp;、大翟@翟佳宁、思宇@思宇呀啊 、润泽@润泽姓郭&nbsp;</span></p><br><p><span>了解更多，或想看我们的线下脱口秀演出，微博/ 微信公众号：@仙人掌喜剧&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>联系我们，可以添加仙人掌小助手：xianrenzhangxiju0829</span></p><br><p><span>你还记得上一段感情是怎么结束的吗？你是挂念ta、还是不再想起ta？你因为ta都做过什么“疯狂”的事？你会忍不住偷看前任现在的动态吗？本期节目的四位主播和大家一起聊聊关于前任的事儿~</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">0:04:26</a>&nbsp;舔狗的自我修养</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">0:06:04</a>&nbsp;刚谈过一次，这期但凡早录几个月都来不了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">0:06:57</a>&nbsp;带着现任来聊前任，大哥你心真大啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">0:15:25</a>&nbsp;异地恋是会呼吸的痛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">0:25:54</a>&nbsp;学好数理化，学生时代恋爱都不怕</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2041">0:34:01</a>&nbsp;前任分手的理由：他要考研，想好好学习</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">0:36:00</a>&nbsp;考研和爱情不可兼得吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2734">0:45:34</a>&nbsp;和前任分手后，我花两万去学PUA</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">0:55:00</a>&nbsp;分手后还能和前任一起吃饭吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4187">1:09:47</a>&nbsp;视监前任，我的方法可多了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4296">1:11:36</a>&nbsp;用大众点评和闲鱼，我找到了前任的现任的所有信息</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">1:13:00</a>&nbsp;分手后发现被绿，我把证据发给前任的公司和现任</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4650">1:17:30</a>&nbsp;和前任分手后，我在网吧住了一个月</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4940">1:22:20</a>&nbsp;分手后我喝了三个月酒，前任结婚找我设计新房</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5500">1:31:40</a>&nbsp;失恋后得抑郁症，看到药钱觉得自己也没病</span></p>]]></description>
